<title>BELGIUM: EU seeking lira-mark rate of 950-980 - source.</title>
<headline>EU seeking lira-mark rate of 950-980 - source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's European Union partners are seeking a rate of between 950 to 980 lira to the German mark for the lira's re-entry into the exchange rate mechanism (ERM), a Spanish offical said on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;Italy is willing to go to 1,000. Other countries are seeking 950 to 980,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>- Brussels newsroom: +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
